{"seq":20,"slug":"solo-developer-fullstack-craft","title":"独立开发者全栈手艺","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/solo-developer-fullstack-craft","rating":{"composite":3.75,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 独立开发者全栈手艺 简介\n\n独立开发者要一个人做完一支团队的活——产品、设计、前端、后端、运维、支持，全压在一双手上。这不是「样样都会一点」的浅尝，而是一门**关于取舍的手艺**：在时间和精力都极度有限的约束下，把一个真实可用的产品端到端地造出来、运维好、还能长期维持。本 hub 面向一个人扛全栈的独立开发者（与 indie-app-shipping 的「上市与生意」、DX hub 的「工具体验」互补——这里讲**独自把整个产品做出来的工程手艺**），从全栈心态与取舍（角色全景、务实选型、范围与杠杆）讲起，覆盖端到端构建（精简全栈架构、前后端打通、从零到部署）、一人运维与可靠性（够用的可观测性、备份与数据安全、一个人的事故应对）、以及可持续的独立开发（对抗复杂度膨胀、用自动化养活自己、可持续节奏与防倦怠）。贯穿全篇的核心是：一个人的最大约束是时间与注意力，所以处处优化「一个人能造、能维护、能长期扛」——选无聊可靠的技术、砍范围、买而非自建、用自动化替代人手、保持代码库可掌控、留住可持续的节奏。把全栈当成一门「在约束下取舍」的手艺，你才能独自走得远。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fullstack-mindset-tradeoffs","title":"全栈心态与取舍","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/solo-developer-fullstack-craft/fullstack-mindset-tradeoffs","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"solo-developer-role-overview","title":"独立开发者的角色全景","url":"/h/cross-discipline/solo-developer-fullstack-craft/fullstack-mindset-tradeoffs/solo-developer-role-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pragmatic-tech-selection","title":"务实的技术选型","url":"/h/cross-discipline/solo-developer-fullstack-craft/fullstack-mindset-tradeoffs/pragmatic-tech-selection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"scope-and-leverage","title":"范围与杠杆","url":"/h/cross-discipline/solo-developer-fullstack-craft/fullstack-mindset-tradeoffs/scope-and-leverage"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"end-to-end-building","title":"端到端构建","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/solo-developer-fullstack-craft/end-to-end-building","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lean-fullstack-architecture","title":"精简全栈架构","url":"/h/cross-discipline/solo-developer-fullstack-craft/end-to-end-building/lean-fullstack-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"frontend-backend-integration","title":"前后端打通","url":"/h/cross-discipline/solo-developer-fullstack-craft/end-to-end-building/frontend-backend-integration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"zero-to-deployment","title":"从零到部署","url":"/h/cross-discipline/solo-developer-fullstack-craft/end-to-end-building/zero-to-deployment"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"solo-ops-and-reliability","title":"一人运维与可靠性","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/solo-developer-fullstack-craft/solo-ops-and-reliability","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"good-enough-observability","title":"够用的可观测性","url":"/h/cross-discipline/solo-developer-fullstack-craft/solo-ops-and-reliability/good-enough-observability"},{"seq":2,"slug":"backups-and-data-safety","title":"备份与数据安全","url":"/h/cross-discipline/solo-developer-fullstack-craft/solo-ops-and-reliability/backups-and-data-safety"},{"seq":3,"slug":"incident-response-solo","title":"一个人的事故应对","url":"/h/cross-discipline/solo-developer-fullstack-craft/solo-ops-and-reliability/incident-response-solo"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"sustainable-solo-development","title":"可持续的独立开发","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/solo-developer-fullstack-craft/sustainable-solo-development","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fighting-complexity-creep","title":"对抗复杂度膨胀","url":"/h/cross-discipline/solo-developer-fullstack-craft/sustainable-solo-development/fighting-complexity-creep"},{"seq":2,"slug":"automation-to-sustain","title":"用自动化养活自己","url":"/h/cross-discipline/solo-developer-fullstack-craft/sustainable-solo-development/automation-to-sustain"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sustainable-pace-anti-burnout","title":"可持续节奏与防倦怠","url":"/h/cross-discipline/solo-developer-fullstack-craft/sustainable-solo-development/sustainable-pace-anti-burnout"}]}]}